# GenAI Knowledge Explorer — Frontend Rules

## Design System
- **Theme**: Dark cosmic/constellation — deep navy (#0a0e1a) background, glowing accents
- **Primary accent**: Violet (#8b5cf6) for concepts and highlights
- **Secondary accents**: Cyan (#06b6d4) for techniques, Emerald (#10b981) for tools, Orange (#f97316) for providers
- **Fonts**: Instrument Serif (display), DM Sans (body), JetBrains Mono (code)

## Architecture
- **Next.js 14** with App Router
- **Tailwind CSS** for styling, with CSS custom properties for the design system
- **D3.js v7** for the force-directed graph and treemap visualizations
- **TypeScript** throughout

## Component Guidelines
- Use `'use client'` directive for interactive components
- Fetch data from `/api/*` endpoints (proxied to the FastAPI backend)
- Handle loading, error, and empty states gracefully
- Use CSS animations for smooth transitions (defined in globals.css)
- Keep components self-contained with their own data fetching

## Visualization Notes
- D3 renders into `<svg>` elements using refs — do NOT use React for SVG DOM manipulation
- Support zoom/pan for the graph view
- Node sizes proportional to topic weight (number of references)
- Color-code by category (concept/technique/tool/provider)
